{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And he touched, etc.</b> The reason for זה is regarding the fire, which is found in the tongue in the masculine." "<b>And your iniquity is removed.</b> It is the iniquity of speech, for he is one of those who mock, like the people of his generation."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:52:23.826527665Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}